---Install a plugin on a project, or refresh an installation's profile output
---
---Requires project#manage with project_id. Without installation_id, creates a project installation (201). A project holds one installation of each plugin: a second create answers 409, and the error whose location is installation_id carries the existing installation's id. Update that installation with updatePluginInstallation. With an installation_id the project owns, refreshes the selected static profile output (200). A core outside the project's jurisdiction answers 421 with the project's home core; retry there.
---
---`POST /api/v1/plugins/{plugin}/installations`
---@param input entire.plugins.CreatePluginInstallationRequest
---@return entire.plugins.PluginInstallation? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_plugin_installation(input) end

---Issue an access token for a plugin installation
---
---**Accepted credentials:** Plugin JWT.
---
---Called by the plugin with a JWT it signed for the installation. A token this core issued is refused. A request with a repository_id scopes the token to that repository. A request with no repository_id takes every permission the installation holds, only repositories:create, or only installations:read. A repositories:create token reaches no repository; it creates repositories in the installation's project through POST /api/v1/repos.
