---Update a project plugin installation
---
---Requires project#manage on the installation's project. The body is a JSON Merge Patch (RFC 7396) of repository_selection and repository_ids: an omitted or null field keeps its value, and repository_ids replaces the whole list. accepted_permissions records the plugin's permissions as the user was shown them; a list that no longer matches the plugin answers 409. Grants follow a changed selection or newly accepted permissions before the response. state and redirect_uri are not installation fields. A state makes the update a plugin-started consent: the profile output carries a receipt whose action is update. The installation's lifecycle state does not change.
---
---`PATCH /api/v1/plugins/{plugin}/installations/{id}`
---@param input entire.plugins.UpdatePluginInstallationRequest
---@return entire.plugins.UpdatePluginInstallationOutputBody? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
